Dataset Performance allows you to monitor the throughput of each object in the Delphix Continuous Data Engine.  

The Timescale options for this quick view are Hour and Day. Hour is the default setting.

you can access the Dataset Performance page one of two ways:
    1. The Banner:
        Continuous Data Engine banner, click on the Resources tab and select Dataset Performance.

    2. View link:
        click on the View link located within the Dataset Performance section of the dashboard

The spikes in data performance graph - the edges are called oracle_mask- this shows detailed information on a particular object or point in time 

Scrolling down toward the bottom of the page shows the list of the objects on the engine and their throughputs
